      "text": "### 3.2 Refresh model (Q-X01, Q-X02) Tiered polling + push for urgent. Per-screen tier is given in §5 next to each page. | Tier | Cadence | Where it applies in ops-console | | ----------------- | ------: | ------------------------------------------------ | | **T2 Dispatch** | 5s | `/dispatch`, `/callcenter`, `/approval-requests` | | **T3 Ops medium** | 15s | `/dashboard`, `/incidents`, `/complaints` | | **T6 Manual** | manual | `/reports`, `/audit` (if added) | Every list / detail API response includes a `UiRefreshMetadata` envelope (`generatedAt`, `staleAfterMs`, `dataFreshness`, `source`). The visual design must give the user a **stale** affordance (banner / tint / icon) and a **refresh** affordance on every live surface; treatment is the design team's call, but it must exist.",
