      "text": "### 3.3 Identity / health context bar (Q-X11, Q-X12) Every screen must surface: - **Top header chip:** actor / realm / tenant / environment (e.g. `ops / production / OC`) - **Sidebar footer:** API health (`healthy` / `degraded` / `down`) + `lastCheckedAt` from `UiHealthEnvelope` - **Page content top:** degraded banner _only when_ a page-critical dependency is degraded (per page; see each brief) `UiHealthEnvelope` is a backend-emitted contract; visual designer doesn't compute it.",
