      "lineStart": 143,
      "lineEnd": 158,
      "text": "### 3.6 Empty / not-ready states (Q-X15) Backend distinguishes empty reasons. Visual designer treats each reason with appropriate copy and affordance: ```ts type EmptyReason = | \"no_data\" // legitimate (no incidents today) | \"not_provisioned\" // feature not turned on | \"fetch_failed\" // backend errored | \"permission_denied\" // user lacks scope | \"external_unavailable\" // adapter down | \"filtered_empty\"; // filters too narrow ``` Each list response that returns 0 items also returns `{ emptyState: { reason, messageCode, nextAction? } }`. Visual must render a different illustration / copy / CTA per reason — collapsing them all to \"No data\" defeats the contract.",
