      "text": "## 5. Per-page functional briefs Schema per page: - **Spec ref** — product spec section to read first - **Refresh tier** — from §3.2 - **Primary persona / roles** — from §2 - **Primary task** — one sentence - **Must-show data** — backend exposes; designer cannot drop - **Must-support actions** — driven by `availableActions`; designer must surface affordance when descriptor is enabled - **Decision points** — what judgment the user is making here - **State variants** — every variant listed must have a designed treatment (loading, the listed empty reasons, degraded, etc.) - **Entry / exit** — typical navigation flows in and out ---",
