      "text": "## Shared rules 1. Record actor, reason, request ID, and source screen for every manual state change. 2. Do not silently release a blocked workflow. 3. Preserve the original business trace when moving work across lanes: `tenantId`, `orderId`, `callId`, `caseNo`, `incidentId`, and reconciliation issue identifiers must remain linked. 4. If the next action needs a different authority role, hand off explicitly; do not treat \"someone else will see it\" as a valid workflow step.",
